    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345290/extras/f1f5f1eb7199adca3ea039f3bf83d3db.poster.avif?t=1750947910\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345290/extras/f1f5f1eb7199adca3ea039f3bf83d3db.webm?t=1750947910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345290/extras/f1f5f1eb7199adca3ea039f3bf83d3db.mp4?t=1750947910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for a magical land that once was but is now lost. What will you find when you get there? Treasures of gold? Lost knowledge? Endless supplies of gummy bears? Whatever the case, Princess Dam and her incorrigible apprentice, Roland the BraveCat, will face all dangers in their quest for friendship and belonging in a world oppressed by the King of Terrors and his army of evil monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345290/extras/34e840956fb408de5207040bcae20f43.poster.avif?t=1750947910\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345290/extras/34e840956fb408de5207040bcae20f43.webm?t=1750947910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345290/extras/34e840956fb408de5207040bcae20f43.mp4?t=1750947910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About five-hour-long, story-driven adventure remastered in 4K.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff\ufeffPoint-and-click exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff\ufeffPre-rendered graphics in the vein of 90's classics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff\ufeffExplore four miniature worlds and sixteen mini dungeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff\ufeffDecipher the mystery of the magiballs, and employ their power to achieve total victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff\ufeffFight an assortment of evil monsters, each more monstrous than the last.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345290/extras/2a6ac53e63a62abdbc3285da85d5af96.poster.avif?t=1750947910\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345290/extras/2a6ac53e63a62abdbc3285da85d5af96.webm?t=1750947910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345290/extras/2a6ac53e63a62abdbc3285da85d5af96.mp4?t=1750947910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345290/extras/f1f5f1eb7199adca3ea039f3bf83d3db.poster.avif?t=1750947910\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345290/extras/f1f5f1eb7199adca3ea039f3bf83d3db.webm?t=1750947910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345290/extras/f1f5f1eb7199adca3ea039f3bf83d3db.mp4?t=1750947910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for a magical land that once was but is now lost. What will you find when you get there? Treasures of gold? Lost knowledge? Endless supplies of gummy bears? Whatever the case, Princess Dam and her incorrigible apprentice, Roland the BraveCat, will face all dangers in their quest for friendship and belonging in a world oppressed by the King of Terrors and his army of evil monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345290/extras/34e840956fb408de5207040bcae20f43.poster.avif?t=1750947910\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345290/extras/34e840956fb408de5207040bcae20f43.webm?t=1750947910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345290/extras/34e840956fb408de5207040bcae20f43.mp4?t=1750947910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About five-hour-long, story-driven adventure remastered in 4K.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff\ufeffPoint-and-click exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff\ufeffPre-rendered graphics in the vein of 90's classics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff\ufeffExplore four miniature worlds and sixteen mini dungeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff\ufeffDecipher the mystery of the magiballs, and employ their power to achieve total victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff\ufeffFight an assortment of evil monsters, each more monstrous than the last.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345290/extras/2a6ac53e63a62abdbc3285da85d5af96.poster.avif?t=1750947910\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345290/extras/2a6ac53e63a62abdbc3285da85d5af96.webm?t=1750947910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345290/extras/2a6ac53e63a62abdbc3285da85d5af96.mp4?t=1750947910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
